          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Have you seen young ones of cats, dogs or other animals? List young ones of five different animals. Have you seen young ones of any non-living things such as a pencil, a chair or an electric bulb?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
