              "type": "text",
              "content": "Reproduction",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is the process of producing new ones of one’s own kind. Why is reproduction necessary? It is necessary for the continuity of life."
            }
          ]
        },
